# CLAUDE.local.md (example)

Copy this to `CLAUDE.local.md` (gitignored) for machine-local context that should
never be committed — absolute paths, personal preferences, environment quirks.

## My environment

- Primary dev root: `/path/to/your/workspace`
- Preferred Python launcher: `py -3` (Windows) / `python3` (Unix)
- Default coding agent: Claude Code

## Notes

Anything here overrides or augments the portable conventions in `CLAUDE.md` for
your machine only. Keep secrets out — use your agent's secret store, not this file.
